# A local skill/command install is a machine-local artifact, not source.
# The kit's own .claude/ was committed once at 48/80 skills and 20/51 commands
# and drifted invisibly to every gate (spec 058 T009 / FR-009). Only the install
# paths are ignored — .claude/settings.json and agents/ stay committable.
.claude/skills/
.claude/commands/
